A('00552','文本','全局池化方差尺度 σ_j^2','CONFIRMED',[(9,'The scale uses all valid support vectors around their pooled mean.'),(9,'σ2 j = max')],'式（5）–（8）构造类别原型、全支持样本池化尺度及归一化类概率；方差有 0.01 下限，须在比较删除恒等式时保留截断。')
A('00552','文本','按 LOO Macro-F1（平局分数化处理）、类均衡 Brier 损失与固定索引字典序择优（Eqs. 23–24）','CONFIRMED',[(12,'Candidates are ranked lexicographically by decreasing LOO Macro-F1, increasing class-balanced Brier loss, and increasing ﬁxed candidate index.'),(12,'Fractional scoring resolves probability ties independently of class indices during selection.')],'主文确写三重字典序和平局分数化；按原式核对了指标定义与选择次序，不等于验证作者代码或跨划分稳健性。')
